questions.questionText:
Consider the following two threads T1 and T2 that update two shared variables a and b. Assume that initially a = b = 1. Though context switching between threads can happen at any time, each statement of T1 or T2 is executed atomically without interruption.
Thread T1:
a = a + 1;
b = b + 1;
Thread T2:
b = 2 * b;
a = 2 * a;
Which one of the following options lists all the possible combinations of values of a and b after both T1 and T2 finish execution?

questions.questionTextEn:
Consider the following two threads T1 and T2 that update two shared variables a and b. Assume that initially a = b = 1. Though context switching between threads can happen at any time, each statement of T1 or T2 is executed atomically without interruption.
Thread T1:
a = a + 1;
b = b + 1;
Thread T2:
b = 2 * b;
a = 2 * a;
Which one of the following options lists all the possible combinations of values of a and b after both T1 and T2 finish execution?

questions.questionTextHi:
निम्नलिखित दो थ्रेड्स T1 और T2 पर विचार कीजिए जो दो साझा चरों a और b को अपडेट करते हैं। मान लीजिए कि प्रारंभ में a = b = 1 है। यद्यपि थ्रेड्स के बीच संदर्भ स्विचिंग (context switching) किसी भी समय हो सकती है, T1 या T2 का प्रत्येक कथन बिना किसी रुकावट के परमाणु रूप से (atomically) निष्पादित होता है।
थ्रेड T1:
a = a + 1;
b = b + 1;
थ्रेड T2:
b = 2 * b;
a = 2 * a;
निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा विकल्प T1 और T2 दोनों के निष्पादन समाप्त होने के बाद a और b के मानों के सभी संभावित संयोजनों को सूचीबद्ध करता है?

questions.questionText:
Consider the following read-write schedule S over three transactions T1, T2, and T3, where subscripts indicate transaction IDs:
S: r1(X); r1(Y); r2(X); r3(X); w3(X); w2(Y); r2(Y); w2(X);
Which of the following transaction schedules is/are conflict equivalent to S?

questions.questionTextEn:
Consider the following read-write schedule S over three transactions T1, T2, and T3, where subscripts indicate transaction IDs:
S: r1(X); r1(Y); r2(X); r3(X); w3(X); w2(Y); r2(Y); w2(X);
Which of the following transaction schedules is/are conflict equivalent to S?

questions.questionTextHi:
तीन लेन-देन (transactions) T1, T2 और T3 पर निम्नलिखित रीड-राइट शेड्यूल S पर विचार कीजिए:
S: r1(X); r1(Y); r2(X); r3(X); w3(X); w2(Y); r2(Y); w2(X);
निम्नलिखित लेन-देन शेड्यूलों में से कौन-सा/से S के संघर्ष तुल्य (conflict equivalent) है/हैं?

